# NOTE: assets/logos/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The rasterized PNGs are
# committed so a fresh clone (and anyone without inkscape/rsvg/magick) has
# working logos for the Typst templates. They are kept in sync with the brand
# SVGs by hooks/pre-commit — see marketing-materials/README.md.

